    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "Apparently the main problem is you're using integer matmuls that don't exist in cublas, so they aren't hitting an optimized path from NVIDIA.\r\n\r\nI also filed https://github.com/openxla/xla/issues/7117 for the case of slow s8xs8->s8 matmuls. Note that s8xs8->s32 matmuls are *much* faster on GPUs with tensorcores: can you use those?",
    "created_at": "2023-11-17T16:34:08Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/17688#issuecomment-1816735409",
    "id": 1816735409,
    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/17688",
